    "description": "POSITION Granite Quarry Operations & General Manager YMG – Yared Mokonnen Granite LOCATION Harar / Babile area REPORTS TO Company Owner / Chief Executive Officer EMPLOYMENT; Full-time SALARY; Negotiable, based on the company salary scale and the candidate’s experience ACCOMMODATION Provided by the company PURPOSE OF THE ROLE To lead all quarry operations with sound planning, efficiency, safety and cost control; to achieve the planned daily and monthly granite block output to the required quality standard; and to manage the workforce, technical specialists, machinery and quarry resources effectively. KEY DUTIES & RESPONSIBILITIES 1 Prepare and implement daily, weekly, monthly and annualquarry production plans. 2 Lead bench preparation, stone cutting, separation, lifting, measuring, grading, recording and loading operations. 3 Ensure the correct use and allocation of wire saws, block cutters, excavators, loaders, generators and other machinery. 4 Develop and monitor a Preventive Maintenance plan so that machinery is serviced regularly. 5 Coordinate the work of geologists, quarry masters, machine operators, maintenance technicians and other staff. 6 Set clear daily tasks and production targets for every employee and machine. 7 Correctly classify the blocks produced into Grade A, Grade Band other quality grades. 8 Ensure that every block is recorded with its identification number, dimensions, cubic-metre volume, quality grade and production date. 9 Control the use and stock of diamond wire, fuel, oil, spare parts and other inputs. 10 Calculate the production cost per cubic metre and reduce unnecessary waste. 11 Ensure that working hours, machine hours, quantities cut, work stoppages and their causes are recorded daily. 12 Enforce occupational safety, the use of personal protective equipment, machine safety and accident-prevention procedures. 13 Monitor environmental protection, waste management, water use and land rehabilitation plans. 14 Work closely with the warehouse, procurement, finance, sales, security and transport departments. 15 Understand customers’ block size and quality requirements and align production with market demand. 16 Verify the accuracy of loading, delivery and block sales documents. 17 Make prompt, sound decisions when problems, accidents, machine breakdowns or production delays occur. 18 Provide the owner with a short daily briefing, a weekly work report and a monthly performance report. 19 Protect company property, equipment, fuel and products from waste, damage and theft. 20 Perform all duties with professional ethics and integrity, in line with company policy. Yared Mokonnen Construction, Granite and Limestone Mining and Processing Company",
